              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eky'aha muheru mwena mukwatanise omu mwoyo, musaasirane, mukundane nk'eishe-emwe, mugirirane embabazi n'omutima omucureezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.8",
